    "Never send more than three follow-up messages to an unresponsive prospect. If a prospect does not reply after three courteous touches, mark them as dormant in your spreadsheet and move forward. Aggressive, nagging follow-ups burn bridges and project amateur desperation. Maintain unshakeable emotional detachment: every unreturned email is simply neutral market data, not a personal rejection.",
